{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And they said, We are twelve, etc.</b> The meaning is: the reason we entered in this order is that we are twelve, and the one is not with us; therefore we separated, and each one entered through a different gate, perhaps one of us would find the one who is not with us. And their saying <b>the youngest is with our father</b> — this is a decisive proof, for righteousness does his mouth utter, for they stated something that could be verified."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:47:57.026064202Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}